          ],
          correctIndex: 1,
          hintsEn: [
            "Bring together everything from this whole year: habitats, matter, sound, electricity, forces, the human body, light, and plants.",
            "This is the year's grand synthesis, from Ms. Thandar's own final word -- \"Rules\": every topic follows its own describable, predictable rule, and finding that rule is the real skill of doing science.",
